#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QToolButton, button_accountAdd)
#: src/conf/account/accountdlg.ui:81
msgid ""
"This button enables you to initialize a new account. You will then be able "
"to edit it using the form on the right."
msgstr ""
"Este botón permítelle preparar unha nova conta. Entón poderá editala "
"mediante o formulario da dereita."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QToolButton, button_accountAdd)
#: src/conf/account/accountdlg.ui:84
